{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/extras/43a3edcf34e04f887d16c15d03825a38.avif?t=1749283250\" width=620 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/extras/c6f035d9592dbc56074eb985901b57a2.poster.avif?t=1749283250\" width=620 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/extras/c6f035d9592dbc56074eb985901b57a2.webm?t=1749283250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/extras/c997b06859050ffde7e52c2d3b64da77.avif?t=1749283250\" width=620 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a place that appears like a mirage.  Disappearing and reappearing over and over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this place, people have been disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seria, a knight of the kingdom, has come to this place to investigate the rumors of villagers suddenly disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, that place was a labyrinth where starved demons run rampant...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the dungeon, there are many monsters and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman wearing a white tunic, adventurers, a suspicious man wearing a hood, the disappearing villagers... Are they friends or enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Seria be able to solve the mystery of this place and escape...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Fantasy Dungeon RPG</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many monsters and traps await the main character, Seria.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills, items, and commands to overcome the enemy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is about analyzing the enemy and searching for a strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hasty strategy puts Seria in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balanced gameplay - The main story can be beaten without grinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to revisit areas to level up, etc. (You can also level-up in the extra dungeons.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto mapping helps track your progress. Exploration is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Device Usage:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be played using a mouse alone, but is optimized for a mouse and keyboard.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/867120?t=1749283250","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/867120?t=1749283250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749283250","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749283250","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/extras/43a3edcf34e04f887d16c15d03825a38.avif?t=1749283250\" width=620 height=76 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/extras/c6f035d9592dbc56074eb985901b57a2.poster.avif?t=1749283250\" width=620 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/extras/c6f035d9592dbc56074eb985901b57a2.webm?t=1749283250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/extras/c997b06859050ffde7e52c2d3b64da77.avif?t=1749283250\" width=620 height=474 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a place that appears like a mirage.  Disappearing and reappearing over and over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this place, people have been disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seria, a knight of the kingdom, has come to this place to investigate the rumors of villagers suddenly disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, that place was a labyrinth where starved demons run rampant...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the dungeon, there are many monsters and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A woman wearing a white tunic, adventurers, a suspicious man wearing a hood, the disappearing villagers... Are they friends or enemies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Seria be able to solve the mystery of this place and escape...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Fantasy Dungeon RPG</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many monsters and traps await the main character, Seria.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your skills, items, and commands to overcome the enemy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is about analyzing the enemy and searching for a strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hasty strategy puts Seria in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balanced gameplay - The main story can be beaten without grinding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need to revisit areas to level up, etc. (You can also level-up in the extra dungeons.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto mapping helps track your progress. Exploration is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Device Usage:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be played using a mouse alone, but is optimized for a mouse and keyboard.</p>","developers":["TUNNEL no.73"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/867120/header.jpg?t=1749283250","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2018 \u00a9TUNNEL no.73","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/867120/173179/84818737a060398241de0daf48f07fcf2bdb0c5d/1750591223/dash_av1.mpd?t=1531501994","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/867120/173179/84818737a060398241de0daf48f07fcf2bdb0c5d/1750591223/dash_h264.mpd?t=1531501994","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/867120/173179/84818737a060398241de0daf48f07fcf2bdb0c5d/1750591223/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1531501994","id":256722595,"name":"lilipalace_demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256722595/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1531501994"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/867120/172313/cef245a9d18162e6192dbdf9e576266fa5a863dc/1750591209/dash_av1.mpd?t=1531184873","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/867120/172313/cef245a9d18162e6192